	"item.mowziesmobs.grant_suns_blessing.text.5": "§lSolar Beam§r§7\nWith empty hand, sneak-right-click to fire a beam in the direction you are looking (costs",
	"item.mowziesmobs.grant_suns_blessing.text.6": "minutes)\n",
	"item.mowziesmobs.grant_suns_blessing.text.7": "§lSupernova§r§7\nWith empty hand, sneak, then left and right click at the same time to create a massive explosion around you (costs",
	"item.mowziesmobs.grant_suns_blessing.text.8": " entire blessing",
	"item.mowziesmobs.grant_suns_blessing.text.9": ")",
	"item.mowziesmobs.earthrend_gauntlet.text.0": "§lBoulder Lift§r§7\nRight-click earthen ground to lift a boulder\nPunch boulder to fire it as projectile\nCharge right-click to lift bigger boulders\n",
	"item.mowziesmobs.earthrend_gauntlet.text.1": "§lTunnel§r§7\nRight-click the air to start tunneling through the ground\nHold right-click and look in the direction you'd like to dig\nRelease right-click to surface and stop tunneling\n",
	"item.mowziesmobs.earthrend_gauntlet.text.2": "§lPillar Rise§r§7\nHold both Sneak and Jump to rise upward on a pillar of earth\nThe pillar's width increases if it grows through geomancy boulders",
	"item.mowziesmobs.earthrend_gauntlet.text.3": "Recharges while in inventory",
	"item.mowziesmobs.sculptor_staff.text.0": "Spawns three small rocks that fire as projectiles after a delay",
	"item.mowziesmobs.sculptor_staff.text.1": "Look in the direction you want the rocks to fire, then right-click",
	"item.mowziesmobs.sand_rake.text.0": "Use on sand to create raked patterns\nRepair with wood planks",
	"item.mowziesmobs.geomancer_beads.text.0": "+3 attack when punching (including attacks with the Earthrend Gauntlet)",
